B.b4w=new A.D("footer",B.W,"Opt-in chat layout (ROOT body node only): a node (typically a `composer`) pinned to the bottom edge of the screen. The body above it takes the remaining height and is NOT wrapped in a page scroll view; the keyboard inset lifts the footer on phones. Absent -> unchanged.",B.l,null,!1)
B.b4H=new A.D("sidebar",B.W,"Opt-in responsive master-detail (ROOT body node only, composes with `footer`): a node (typically a `list`) rendered as a persistent fixed-width left sidebar with a divider when the available width >= `sidebarMinWidth`; the body fills the rest. Narrower (phones) the sidebar is not rendered and the body is unchanged. Absent -> unchanged.",B.l,null,!1)
