B.hDX=new A.D("equalWidth",B.a8,"Wrapped chip group only (segmented-single-choice-0811): lay every child out at EQUAL width spanning the row's full bounded content width instead of a free-width Wrap, folding into additional equal rows (never a ragged one) when they don't all fit one row. Use for an independent-toggle chip group (e.g. Stations/Subway/Events) so the row reads as one aligned system. Default false (legacy free-width Wrap) \u2014 chrome that mixes unlike children (e.g. a caption+button pill) should keep the default.",B.l,null,!1)
