B.i1w=new A.D("subtitleColumns",B.kV,"Columns shown as subtitle. Each entry is normally a column name; an entry MAY instead be an object `{fromSetting, fallback}` to pick the column per-viewer at render time from a board setting (e.g. each chat viewer reading their own `t_en`/`t_ko`/\u2026 translation column) \u2014 `board.settings[fromSetting]`, if a non-empty string, names the column; else `fallback` if given; else that slot shows nothing. A row missing the resolved column, or holding an empty value there, shows no subtitle for that row (never falls back per-row \u2014 fallback only covers the setting being unset).",B.l,null,!1)
