B.hPv=new A.D("shareAware",B.a8,"Opt-out (default true): when the host has wired an AccessResolver (project sharing), the add-entry/attach compose bar honors canComment(rowId) \u2014 hidden when the current user cannot comment here. Set false to exempt this thread even when the host's hooks are wired globally. Inert when the host wires no hooks.",B.l,null,!1)
