B.hLQ=new A.D("allowAddStage",B.a8,'Graph layout: show the "add stage" (+) affordance in the milestone header row (default on when `milestoneOrder` is NOT explicitly configured \u2014 stages are then data-derived and lexically ordered, so a new milestone value can be minted to sort strictly between two existing ones). When `milestoneOrder` IS configured, only "add at end" is offered (inserting mid-list would require editing the configured array, not a data write).',B.l,null,!1)
