B.hYZ=new A.D("cluster",B.a8,"Opt-in zoom-aware grid clustering of pins (default off = every row renders its own marker, unchanged). Groups nearby pins into count-badge clusters that split apart as the map zooms in \u2014 keeps a large table (e.g. thousands of geocoded rows) smooth at a zoomed-out view instead of rendering one widget per row.",B.l,null,!1)
