B.hHG=new A.D("detailPopup",B.a8,'Opt-in select-then-act model: tapping a marker or a point-list row animates the camera to that point and shows a small in-map detail card (label + detailFields + an "Open website" button) instead of firing the row action immediately. Default off preserves today\'s exact behavior (row action fires straight from the tap).',B.l,null,!1)
