B.hL0=new A.D("linkColumn",B.L,'Column the detailPopup\'s "Open website" button reads its URL from (default "url"). Only used when detailPopup is true; a blank/absent value on the row hides the button. The button still fires the node\'s own action (default fn "openLink") so link-safety behavior is unchanged \u2014 this only tells it which column to read.',B.l,null,!1)
B.i0R=new A.D("layers",B.W,"Opt-in ORDERED layer toolkit: a List of {id, label, kind, on?, ...kind-specific config reusing the legacy prop shapes (markers: colorColumn/colors/cluster/maxMarkers; network: linesAsset2/lineColor2/lineWidth2/linesFilterProperty2; choropleth: choropleth + optional pickColumns; geojson: geojsonAsset/geojson; labels: no extra config \u2014 toggles marker caption pills)}. 2+ entries render a compact collapsible layer panel (top-right) with a toggle per layer (choropleth rows also surface their metric-pick chips); toggle state is ephemeral/session-only, never written back to board JSON. Absent/under-2 \u2192 today's exact rendering (legacy flat props + overlayToggle/linesToggle chips), fully unchanged.",B.l,null,!1)
