B.hSQ=new A.D("layerPanel",B.W,"Opt-in on-map LAYERS control (mapstudio-0814): true, or { align: topStart|topEnd|bottomStart|bottomEnd (default topStart \u2014 the opposite corner from overlayAlign's default, so both may be used together), title, on: false to disable }. Renders a floating card (collapsed = a circular layers button) listing this node's sourceLayers with a visibility toggle each, plus a FILTER popup for any layer declaring `filterable`. It writes the SAME runtime overrides as the mapSetLayerVisible / mapSetFilter actions, so panel state survives rebuilds and agrees with applet-driven buttons. REQUIRES this node's `id` (overrides are keyed by it); an id-less or layer-less glmap renders no panel. A layer declaring selectedFeature is omitted (it draws only the selection); `panel: false` on a layer opts it out. Absent = no panel and NO layout change (no Stack wrapper).",B.l,null,!1)
