B.i67=new A.D("dock",B.bG,"Where the controls dock around the body. auto (default) = side panel on wide surfaces; on phones every dock becomes a floating button PILL (bottom-center, raised clear of the OS gesture zone) that opens the controls as a HALF-height draggable sheet \u2014 the content stays partially visible; drag the sheet's top handle to expand, close via \xd7, downward fling, or barrier tap.",B.d7j,null,!1)
