B.hZV=new A.D("children",B.W,"Explicit control-block node specs (default: filter + group + sort for `table`).",B.l,null,!1)
B.hJk=new A.D("blocksTable",B.b4,'Opt-in table of USER-ADDED control-block rows (columns: id, kind [filter|group|sort|range|segment|search], column?, label?, order). When set, the dock gains an "Add control" affordance (+ button) and a per-block remove (\xd7); blocks render from these rows AFTER the static `children`, through the SAME datafilter/datagroup/datasort/datarange/datasegment/datasearch node builders.',B.l,null,!1)
