B.hc2=new A.dp("datacontrols",'The dockable DATA CONTROLS region \u2014 the databoard spine\'s face. Hosts control blocks (children; default = datafilter + datagroup + datasort for `table`) docked around `body`. Controls publish to the board-level shared data config; any view with configSource:"board" subscribes, so filters/grouping/sort persist across chart, table and map representations.',B.d0D,!1)
