B.hHl=new A.D("sectionColumn",B.L,"Optional column whose distinct values group the bars into labeled sections with a separator (e.g. one strip carrying several days' worth of bars).",B.l,null,!1)
B.i0q=new A.D("play",B.a8,'Opt-in auto-play cursor (default off): shows a small play/pause button that steps the selection one bar at a time left-to-right across the whole strip (sections group visually but never interrupt the sweep), publishing through the same choice-filter path a manual tap uses so every configSource:"board" subscriber follows the wave. Any manual tap/drag stops play in place.',B.l,null,!1)
