B.hcF=new A.dp("lanegraph","A git-graph-style lane view: one row per record, newest at the top, with a left gutter drawing lines that branch from a parent row, cross lanes (the branch takes the child's lane colour), merge back when closed and end at a hollow square when archived. Shape = state (diamond waiting, dot running, ringed dot closed, filled square blocked); colour = lane. Rows truncate (title, subtitle, date); at most 4 lane columns under 480px wide (excess clamps into the last). Read-only.",B.d1i,!1)
