B.hRD=new A.D("treeRail",B.a8,"Two-level: column 1 becomes a DIRECTORY TREE \u2014 folders nest (sub-projects), non-folders are leaves, and the tree never descends into a non-folder (a task's children are its log). Column 2 then lists the selected folder's non-folder children only.",B.l,null,!1)
