B.hFU=new A.D("showProgress",B.a8,'Each folder row shows a thin bar + "NN%" \u2014 DONE/TOTAL among its TASK descendants (kindColumn == fileValue) rolled up over the whole contains-subtree; notes/attachments/sub-groups are excluded. Requires statusColumn; a folder with no task descendants shows nothing.',B.l,null,!1)
