B.hYm=new A.D("uiCreateActions",B.W,'Engine-built CREATE entries by name (explorer_ui_actions.dart), each with its own engine-localized label + visibility, appended to the landing / New menu items and (with focusRoot + childAdd) to the "+ New <child>" chooser: "composeStartFromPrompt" (Moku "Start from a prompt\u2026": popup \u2192 blank scenario \u2192 co-build panel pre-filled). Unknown names are ignored.',B.l,null,!1)
