B.hPu=new A.D("leafChildKinds",B.W,'Sub-leaf tree: child kindColumn values of a LEAF shown nested under it in the tasks column (e.g. ["task"] = sub-tasks). Other children (the leaf\'s log) stay out of the rails. Leaf \u22ee menus gain a create-sub-leaf item.',B.l,null,!1)
