B.hdi=new A.dp("stepline","The Stepline surface (stepline-1113): edit a model's step recipe. Step cards in run order with needs \u2192 makes chips and an on/off switch; drag the grip or use arrow keys / Move buttons to reorder (a move that puts a step before the step that makes its input is refused); turning a step off or removing it flags the steps that depended on it; an Add step library (existing, new-method preview and placeholder steps); Export recipe as the JSON file the model kit reads. Pure Dart, no network, never runs model code.",B.cUR,!1)
