B.hdo=new A.dp("timercard",'One row\'s countdown and tracked time, for a task page. Countdown: big remaining time, play/pause, reset, length chips (5 min, 10 min, 25 min, 1 hr, Custom). Time tracked: the total, the live stretch with pause, a by-day list of log rows (newest first) and "+ Add time by hand". Same `timer` / `tracking` props, defaults and alarm action as grouplist; on web a hint says alarms ring only while the tab is open.',B.d2u,!1)
